{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411070","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1341107001:1":{"text":"格尔达女士，这次的“鬼影密室”是你设计的吗？","source_cn":"格尔达女士，这次的“鬼影密室”是你设计的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C0BB1A8E05E9B70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341107002:1":{"text":"当然啦，亲爱的。我好不容易才争取来祭典项目的承办资格，为了办好它，我可费了好大的力气呢！","source_cn":"当然啦，亲爱的。我好不容易才争取来祭典项目的承办资格，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B2A451503B49530","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341107003:1":{"text":"最初我想举办一个温泉游乐会，举行一些休闲小游戏，但在祭典前两周我临时改了主意。事实证明，我的选择非常英明！","source_cn":"最初我想举办一个温泉游乐会，举行一些休闲小游戏，但在祭...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2EF6DD604373B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1341107003":{"text":"最初我想举办一个温泉游乐会，举行一些休闲小游戏，但在祭典前两周我临时改了主意。事实证明，我的选择非常英明！","source_cn":"最初我想举办一个温泉游乐会，举行一些休闲小游戏，但在祭典前两周我临时改了主意。事实证明，我的选择非常英明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2EF6DD604373B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341107004:1":{"text":"因为一本恐怖小说！亲爱的，你能相信吗？那本恐怖小说吓得我两个晚上没有睡好，但即使这样，我还是对它欲罢不能。","source_cn":"因为一本恐怖小说！亲爱的，你能相信吗？那本恐怖小说吓得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3544CADFAF2C1CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":